    "status": "completed",
    "answer": "Reviewed the available Harbor Checking history, all unread emails and notes, and the discovered leads. The uploaded transaction history is the only account coverage available.\n\n- **ShopMart:** Two $95.59 charges posted on Sept. 10, but the order email confirms one order. I submitted refund request **SM-1001** and scheduled a follow-up for Oct. 20.\n- **CloudBox:** The $59.99 annual charge posted Oct. 1 after the trial. I submitted refund case **CB-1002** and scheduled a follow-up for Oct. 20. The charge was within the notice\u2019s 14-day refund window when reviewed.\n- **CloudBox cancellation:** Your note says you no longer need the service. I saved a waiting approval case to cancel the $59.99 annual plan; I did not change the service.\n- **Spotify:** $11.99 monthly. I found no evidence it\u2019s unwanted or unused, so I saved it as reviewed without contacting Spotify.\n- **Oakview Apartments:** $1,625 monthly rent. I found no refund or billing issue and saved it as reviewed.\n- **Harbor Bank:** The $12 maintenance fee already has a matching $12 reversal.\n\nThe review status is complete. No refunds have posted yet.",
